05E        ││││││                       ; and then bring it high. Enable must be high
05E        ││││││                       ; for TDC7200 to perform conversions.
           ││││││                       ;
05E        ││││││                       ; GLE: 8-Nov-2025 (added two more dly_us calls)
           ││││││                       ;
