12F        │                            ; Name: get_event
           │                            ;
12F        │                            ; Routine to get a nuclear physics event
           │                            ;
12F        │                            ; Aquires data from the 4 ADCS (A, B, C, T) for all hit channels on
12F        │                            ; both PSD chips!
           │                            ;
12F        │                            ; We look at ORs and keep getting samples until both PSD0 and PSD1 ORs low!
12F        │                            ; Each time we get A, B, C, T samples, we send them to the FIFO
12F        │                            ; Each time send a word to the FIFO, we need to write to VALID_PORT (or LAST_PORT)
