147        ││││││                       ; $$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$
147        ││││││                       ;  Only PSD 0 needs attention
147        ││││││                       ; $$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$$
