147        ││││││                .psd0:
           ││││││
147        ││││││                       ; Bring token_in (bit 6 of PSD0_PORT) low i.e. active!!!!
147        ││││││                       ; Notablly sel_ext_addr (bit 7) must be low!
147        ││││││                       ; The other bits in port ALSO need to be low
147        ││││││                       ; except for acq_clk (bit 3). It needs to be high.
147        ││││││                       ; PSD chips put out new analog outputs when acq_clk goes high!
