149  05008 │││││                        or op, 08                      ; Set bit 3				; acq clk for PSD 0 high
14A  2D005 │││││                        output op, PSD0_OPORT
14B  20034 ╰──────⤙                     call dly_us                    ; Give analog outputs chance to settle
